{"id":"8fc1b7ff910f430e","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-filter-powers.md","title":"Filter of Powers","display":"Filter of Powers","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-filter-powers","aliases":["93-prop-filter-powers"],"display":"Filter of Powers","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-filter]]","[[93-df-powers]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-ultrafilter]]","[[93-df-finite-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-filter-powers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-filter-powers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Filter of Powers"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-filter-powers-—-Filter-of-Powers\">prop-filter-powers — Filter of Powers</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\">\\(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(I\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> is the Boolean similarity type of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}\\)</span> are the power and explicit coordinate-projection constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\\)</span> is the ultrafilter predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}powers}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\n\\land I\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(F,\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}))\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in I\\;\\exists U\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\n\\land F=\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf A,I)^{-1}[U]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\\forall j\\in I\\;\\forall U&#39;\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U&#39;,\\mathbf A)\n\\land F=\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(j;\\mathbf A,I)^{-1}[U&#39;]\n\\to j=i\\land U&#39;=U\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}powers}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\n\\land I\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(F,\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}))\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in I\\;\\exists U\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\n\\land F=\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf A,I)^{-1}[U]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\\forall j\\in I\\;\\forall U&#39;\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U&#39;,\\mathbf A)\n\\land F=\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(j;\\mathbf A,I)^{-1}[U&#39;]\n\\to j=i\\land U&#39;=U\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>For a finite product, an ultrafilter selects one factor. A Cartesian product of ultrafilters is generally not maximal; even in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2^2\">\\(\\mathbf2^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{(1,1)\\}\">\\(\\{(1,1)\\}\\)</span> is not an ultrafilter.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-filter-powers-—-Filter-of-Powers","text":"prop-filter-powers — Filter of Powers","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolalg]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-powers","status":"resolved","id":"10bfe2126b30365e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-powers]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}$ is the Boolean similarity type of [[93-df-boolalg]], and $\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ and $\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}$ are the power and explicit coordinate-projection constructors of [[93-df-powers]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-powers","status":"resolved","id":"10bfe2126b30365e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}$ is the Boolean similarity type of [[93-df-boolalg]], and $\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ and $\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}$ are the power and explicit coordinate-projection constructors of [[93-df-powers]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ is the ultrafilter predicate of [[93-df-ultrafilter]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}powers}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\n\\land I\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\\\\n&\\Bigl(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(F,\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}))\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in I\\;\\exists U\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\n\\land F=\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf A,I)^{-1}[U]\\\\\n&\\hspace{10em}\\land\\forall j\\in I\\;\\forall U'\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U',\\mathbf A)\n\\land F=\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(j;\\mathbf A,I)^{-1}[U']\n\\to j=i\\land U'=U\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf2^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\{(1,1)\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1785,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["757a95a2c335d9fb","9beeac4373d773f8","10bfe2126b30365e","7087f500cc845c3b","fc989d8f8938c283","6b63f2f43b5511ee"]}